     "body": "<p>The installation options will now be set as follows when running \"quick\" install:</p>\n\n<p>FEDORA_SERVERHOST = localhost<br/>\nAPIA_AUTH_REQUIRED = false<br/>\nSSL_AVAILABLE = true<br/>\nAPIA_SSL_REQUIRED = false<br/>\nAPIM_SSL_REQUIRED = true<br/>\nSERVLET_ENGINE = included<br/>\nTOMCAT_HOME = fedoraHome/tomcat<br/>\nTOMCAT_HTTP_PORT = 8080<br/>\nTOMCAT_SHUTDOWN_PORT = 8005<br/>\nTOMCAT_SSL_PORT = 8443<br/>\nKEYSTORE_FILE = included<br/>\nDATABASE = included<br/>\nDATABASE_DRIVER = included<br/>\nDATABASE_USERNAME = fedoraAdmin<br/>\nDATABASE_PASSWORD = fedoraAdmin<br/>\nXACML_ENABLED = true<br/>\nRI_ENABLED = false<br/>\nREST_ENABLED = false<br/>\nMESSAGING_ENABLED = false<br/>\nDEPLOY_LOCAL_SERVICES = true</p>\n\n<p>Note: These settings happen to provide for the ability to successfully run:<br/>\n$ant junit -Dtest=fedora.test.AllSystemTestsConfigA<br/>\nafter installation has completed.</p>",
